### Page 1 of 39

```text
Planning and Development Office
2101 O’Neil Avenue, Suite 202, Cheyenne WY 82001
(Phone) 307-637-6282
(Fax) 307-637-6366

MEMO
To:
Honorable Mayor Patrick Collins and Members of the City Council
From:
Jeanie Shrednik, PLA, Parks, and Greenway Planner
Subject: A Resolution Acknowledging Receipt of the Rotary Park Master Plan Report

Date:
September 21, 2024

Background:

The item for consideration is review and acknowledgement of receipt for the Rotary Park Master Plan
Report. The 12+/- acre park property is located at the northwest corner of Dell Range Blvd. and
Powderhouse Rd.  On January 2, 2024, the City of Cheyenne contracted with DHM Design to develop a
Master Plan for the park and is city contract No. 7882. The site was donated to the city by the Cheyenne
Rotary Club Foundation on April 24, 2024.   The Master Plan will serve as a guideline for the future design,
construction, and operation of the new community park area.

Enclosures:
Resolution
Rotary Park Master Plan Report, September 2024

  Planning and Development Department
2101 O’Neil Avenue, Suite 202, Cheyenne WY 82001
(Phone) 307-637-6282 (Fax) 307-637-6366
```

### Page 2 of 39

```text
RESOLUTION NO. __________

ENTITLED: "A RESOLUTION ACKNOWLEDGING RECEIPT OF THE ROTARY
PARK MASTER PLAN REPORT."

WHEREAS, the City of Cheyenne retained DHM Design as prime consultant to develop
a Master Plan for the Rotary Park;

WHEREAS, A public open house was held on July 16, 2024, to gain public input on
options for the park;

WHEREAS, a project steering committee consisting of members of the Cheyenne Rotary
Club Foundation, City Planning and Development, and Community Recreation and Events has
met five (5) times;

WHEREAS, DHM Design has completed the scope of services pertaining to the Master
Plan in accordance with City Contract No. 7882, and has submitted the Rotary Park Master Plan
Report ("Master Plan") to the City;

WHEREAS, the Master Plan provides direction for the future development of
approximately twelve (12) acres of land within the City owned property, located at the northwest
corner of Dell Range Boulevard and Powderhouse Road, as a municipal park while preserving
open space, and natural resources in the area;

WHEREAS, the Master Plan provides direction for the future development of Greater
Cheyenne Greenway connections within and connecting to the park; and

WHEREAS, the City of Cheyenne Planning Commission held a Public Meeting on
October 21, 2024, and accepted public comments, and recommended the approval of the Master
Plan to the City Governing Body.

NOW THEREFORE BE IT RESOLVED BY THE GOVERNING BODY OF THE
CITY OF CHEYENNE, WYOMING, that the Governing Body acknowledges receipt of the
Rotary Park Master Plan Report, dated September 2024;

BE IT FURTHER RESOLVED, that a complete copy of the Rotary Park Master Plan
Report, dated September 2024, shall be on file for public inspection in the office of the City
Clerk of the City of Cheyenne; and

BE IT FURTHER RESOLVED, that the Rotary Park Master Plan Report, dated
September 2024, will serve as a guideline for the future design, construction, and affiliated
operations of the new park area at the afore mentioned location.

6:43 pm, Oct 21 2024
```

