Playground
This concept features a smaller playground with one climbing boulder. A seating
area with a shade sail is located next to the climbing area.
Vegetation
The site is primarily planted with native turf. Massings of western wheatgrass
continue the meandering theme by weaving throughout the park and trail system.
Pockets of overstory trees are located along the trail to provide shade.
